abstract: >
  405 model listings from 50 providers with list prices, context-tier ladders,
  time-of-day price windows and LMArena Elo with confidence bounds. Produced
  by https://undominated.ai. LMArena fields are CC BY 4.0 from the official
  Hugging Face dataset. OpenRouter prices are vendor list rates. No Artificial
  Analysis field is included.
